Package: spefa
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Stochastic Frontier with Fixed Effects and Endogeneity
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Massimo", "Giannini", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                   email = "massimo.giannini@uniroma2.it",
                   comment = "University of Rome Tor Vergata, Department of Enterprise Engineering")
Description: Maximum-likelihood estimation of the spatial autoregressive
    stochastic frontier model with individual fixed effects (removed by
    first differencing) and endogenous regressors handled through a Gaussian
    control function, as in Giannini (2025) <doi:10.1080/17421772.2024.2414962>.
    Returns coefficient estimates and standard errors, spatially-corrected
    technical (in)efficiency scores, and direct, indirect and total marginal
    impacts. Depends only on base R.
